& [P6ProjectionAuthorityClassInventory] is the projection authority class inventory
  + [authority_class] is SOP_source_authority
  + [authority_class] is canonical_specification_authority
  + [authority_class] is kernel_record_authority
  + [authority_class] is accepted_completion_review_authority
  + [authority_class] is accepted_human_override_record
  + [authority_class] is accepted_interrupt_resolution_record
  + [non_authority_class] is surface_projection
  + [non_authority_class] is surface_snapshot
  + [non_authority_class] is generated_projection
  + [non_authority_class] is surface_local_state
  + [non_authority_class] is adapter_message
  + [non_authority_class] is chat_transcript_projection
  + [non_authority_class] is Codex_thread_display
  + [non_authority_class] is terminal_output_projection
  + [non_authority_class] is IRC_channel_log
  + [non_authority_class] is Matrix_room_event
  + [non_authority_class] is web_UI_state
  + [non_authority_class] is Langflow_diagram
  + [non_authority_class] is graph_checkpoint_display
  + [non_authority_class] is graph_transition_trace_display
  + [non_authority_class] is packet_candidate_display
  + [non_authority_class] is human_handoff_display
  + [gated_authority_class] is assignment_record
  + [gated_authority_class] is dispatch_record
  + [gated_authority_class] is operations_control_record
  + [gated_authority_class] is live_machine_control_record

  = must: render every non_authority_class with an authority notice before it can support human or agent decisions
  = must: reject any projection, adapter message, conversation event, checkpoint display, generated projection, packet candidate display, or handoff display as source authority unless a later accepted route elevates it
  = must: route assignment, dispatch, operations control, and live machine control through future source-preserved authority, not through P6 projection inventory

& [P6ProjectionObligationFamilyMatrix] is the projection obligation family matrix
  + [obligation_family] is authority_notice_freshness_and_nonpromotion_rendering
  + [owning_slice] is P6-S02
  + [required_input_authority] is P2 authority states, P8 nonpromotion, P5 checkpoint nonauthority, FSC4 authority notice invariant, and Post-P5 readiness
  + [obligation_family] is multi_surface_projection_envelope_and_surface_specific_boundaries
  + [owning_slice] is P6-S03
  + [required_input_authority] is P6-S02 authority notice contract, FSC4 surface boundaries, IR5 projection proof support, P4 packet visibility, and P5 handoff visibility
  + [obligation_family] is inbound_action_classification_and_surface_mutation_boundary
  + [owning_slice] is P6-S04
  + [required_input_authority] is P6-S03 envelope, FSC4 adapter mutation boundary, P4 no-assignment no-dispatch boundary, and P5 interrupt handoff route
  + [obligation_family] is projection_fixture_snapshot_plan_and_generated_projection_nonpromotion
  + [owning_slice] is P6-S05
  + [required_input_authority] is P6-S02 through P6-S04 contracts and P8 proof fixture evaluation boundaries
  + [obligation_family] is surface_adapter_langflow_dependency_deferral_and_implementation_activation_boundary
  + [owning_slice] is P6-S06
  + [required_input_authority] is P6-S05 fixture plan, IR5 implementation proof support, and accepted no-package-mutation posture
  + [obligation_family] is P6_completion_and_downstream_gate
  + [owning_slice] is P6-S07
  + [required_input_authority] is accepted P6-S01 through P6-S06 completion reviews

  = must: keep each obligation family dependency-closed inside its owning slice after upstream acceptance
  = must: reject downstream work that depends on a family before the owning slice completion review accepts it

